  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection, Inclusion and Gender equality (SPRING) - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Social Protection, Inclusion and Gender Equality (SPRING) program supports the Philippine Government to strengthen social protection programs, gender mainstreaming and budgeting systems, and advance social inclusion for people with disabilities and Indigenous Peoples. 

SPRING is delivered primarily through a Managing Contractor in partnership with DFAT, to support the Philippines&#x2019; poverty reduction objectives and enhance gender equality. The program also works with multilateral agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
